WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:04.290
Whew, that's heavy!

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:05.850
W-what is that?!

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:07.590
I found it in the storeroom!

00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:09.960
Those're cannonballs!

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:13.930
We finally got a cannon,
so I thought I'd do some practice!

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:16.400
Then just leave it to me!

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:19.600
I believe it was when I was three
that I jumped on a cannonball

00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:21.440
flying my way and traveled
halfway around the world!

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:24.140
--How do you work this thing?
--Listen!

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:26.670
Hey, Zoro! Do you know how to work it?!

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:29.670
He's been fast asleep all this time.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:32.480
He's no fun.

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:36.720
A little further to the south is
a reef that'd make a perfect target!

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:37.790
For reals?!

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:38.790
Let's go! Let's go!

00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:41.690
<i>--Let's go there!
--Hey! You're gonna fire
a cannon without me?!</i>

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:47.190
People used to call me
Cannon Master Usopp, you know! Listen!

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:55.060
<i>"The Three-Sword Style's Past!
Zoro and Kuina's Vow!"</i>

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:16.880
Hey!

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:20.530
Hey!

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:22.460
I'm here to challenge your dojo!

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:26.260
Someone strong, come out! Fight me!

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:30.540
Dojo-challenging is certainly
rare these days.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:33.110
Hmph! Don't take me lightly
just 'cause I'm a kid!

00:03:33.110 --> 00:03:35.780
I'm unrivaled in the next village over!

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:39.280
Very well. I accept.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:41.450
If I win, I get your dojo!

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:45.190
--And if you lose?
--T-then, uhh...

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:47.590
I'll become a student here!

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:51.360
That will be fine. Now, then...

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:52.690
Kuina!

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.560
Yes, Father?

00:03:56.560 --> 00:04:00.370
<i>What?! You're not gonna fight me?!</i>

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:05.470
Kuina is a girl, but she's even
stronger than the adults in the dojo.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:08.470
I say this, even as her parent...

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:11.250
Fine!

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.610
Then please come inside.

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:18.050
I can use any I want?

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:19.380
To your heart's content.

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:25.090
All right, then! Let's begin!

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:27.320
(Alright! Bring it on!)

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.830
Bow before the gods!

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:33.070
--What's he doing?
--He's ridiculous...

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:35.400
Bow to each other!

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:36.390
Begin!

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:55.480
D-damn it!

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:06.830
You've studied Two-Sword
Style techniques before?

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:11.040
No! Today's the first time
I've ever held a bamboo sword!

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.240
Today's your first time?

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:18.850
<i>Damn it! I'm strong!
And I'm gonna get even stronger!</i>

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:22.840
<i>I refuse... I refuse
to lose to this girl!</i>

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:28.720
Oww...

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:31.830
Why doesn't he dodge?!

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:34.930
Match over!

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:37.030
He's like a boar.

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:38.200
Come now, Kuina!

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:43.000
It's 10 years too early for
an amateur to use the Two-Sword Style!

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:46.000
What?!

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:52.610
What? We can fight
another match, if you want!

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:54.750
Damn it! A loss is a loss!

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:57.720
Yes. It's good to accept defeat
gracefully. Then, you'll...

00:05:57.720 --> 00:06:01.190
Yeah! I'll become a student here!
Got a problem with that?!

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:03.560
None whatsoever.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:08.200
I'm going to train lots
and lots and lots

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:12.330
<i>and then I will beat you!</i>

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:14.130
Remember that!

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:17.970
That day'll never come.

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:18.570
Match over!

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:21.970
The winner is Kuina, with
2000 wins and 0 losses!

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:24.310
D-damn it...

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:28.110
You're still as weak as ever, Zoro!

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:31.910
You're so pathetic.
Especially for a boy.

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:36.920
Hey! Zoro isn't weak!

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:38.990
He's the strongest one
out of all the guys!

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:40.590
He's even beat grownups!

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:44.430
<i>But he's weaker than me.</i>

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:48.600
Even with two swords,
a weakling's still a weakling.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:53.160
You losers'd do good to stay quiet.
Your howling makes you pitiful.

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:05.650
You lost again, Zoro...

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:08.880
Ever after you've grown so strong.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:09.780
<i>Sensei!</i>

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:13.790
Are you giving her secret training
'cause she's your daughter?!

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:15.090
Don't cheat!

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:18.730
No, no. I do no such thing.

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:21.500
Zoro did indeed grow stronger.

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:25.700
But Kuina has grown stronger as well.

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:27.630
--Zoro?
--Zoro?

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:29.300
I'm gonna wash my face.

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:38.180
Damn it!

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:42.050
Why can't I beat Kuina?!
Why?! Why?!

00:08:42.050 --> 00:08:46.210
I'm gonna be the strongest
man in the world! So why?!

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:53.760
Tonight... I'm gonna fight her again!

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:59.630
A mere year since he became a pupil...

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:02.540
Zoro's improvement is nothing
short of spectacular.

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:06.470
He trains incomparably more
than any of the others.

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:09.240
So I suppose it's only natural.

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:14.720
<i>But... it seems he's still
no match for Kuina-san.</i>

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:19.220
Female swordsmen are faced
with immense walls.

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:24.210
As she is now, I cannot
let her inherit the dojo.

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:26.860
Father!

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:28.260
<i>Kuina-san!</i>

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:31.500
It's not nice to eavesdrop, Kuina.

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:36.490
<i>I will become the world's
greatest swordsman! You'll see!</i>

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:42.610
Kuina. As a girl...

00:09:42.610 --> 00:09:46.170
...you can never be
the world's strongest.

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:08.270
Zoro?!

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:10.640
What're you doing out here?

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:15.200
<i>That's my line! What are you
doing here at this hour?!</i>

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:21.950
I'm here to challenge you
to your 2001st fight!

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:25.420
I plan to make this
my last fight with you!

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:26.790
I'm going to end this!

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:29.260
Fight me with a real sword!

00:10:29.260 --> 00:10:31.490
You have a real one, don't you?!

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.020
Against me?

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:41.020
Sure.

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:57.140
<i>The Wado Ichimonji...</i>

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.990
<i>Two real swords are heavy, huh?</i>

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:12.830
It seems you still lack strength!

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.390
S-shut up!

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:29.570
My 2001st win.

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:38.640
Damn it...

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:42.790
Damn it...

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:45.730
This sucks...

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:53.230
I'm the one who should be
crying out of frustration.

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:55.200
Eh?

00:12:55.200 --> 00:13:01.710
You see, when girls grow up,
they get weaker than men...

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:04.870
Even you'll catch up to me soon...

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:11.590
You're always saying you're going
to be the world's best swordsman.

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:16.820
My father told me that
a girl can never be that...

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:19.490
I know...

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:24.930
I know that! But...
But it's frustrating!

00:13:24.930 --> 00:13:28.540
You're lucky, Zoro. You're a boy.

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:32.440
I want to be the world's
greatest swordsman, too!

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:36.080
My breasts have even started
to grow out now...

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:39.880
If only... If only I had
been born a man...

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:44.690
Don't be whining like that
after you beat me!

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:48.520
That's not fair! You're my goal!

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:49.460
Zoro...

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:51.290
Boy this, girl that!

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:54.460
Are you gonna say that stuff too
when I beat you someday?!

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:56.630
You act like none of it is skill!

00:13:56.630 --> 00:14:00.470
You're insulting all the hard
training I've been doing!

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:02.770
So don't say that stuff!

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:06.970
Promise me!

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:11.510
<i>Someday, one of us will be
the world's greatest swordsman!</i>

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:14.170
We'll compete to see who gets there!

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.750
You dummy. You're so weak...

00:14:25.930 --> 00:14:27.920
--It's a promise!
--It's a promise!

00:14:37.070 --> 00:14:38.840
Whoa...

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:42.170
She's gotten even
stronger than before!

00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:51.890
<i>Gotta get stronger! So I can
hold lots of swords just fine!</i>

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:54.680
<i>If two's not enough,
then I'll use three!</i>

00:14:59.860 --> 00:15:02.090
What do you guys want?

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:06.800
Kuina...

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:09.460
Kuina's dead...

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:25.050
Apparently, she slipped and fell
down the storehouse steps...

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:26.120
Storehouse?

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:31.060
Seems she was looking for a sharpening
stone for her beloved sword.

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:32.730
What would she need that for?

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:34.430
I don't know...

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:36.500
She was just a child, too...

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:38.830
There's just no understanding people...

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:42.670
No one knows what's
just around the corner...

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:17.530
People are such fragile things, Zoro...

00:17:20.170 --> 00:17:25.640
Kuina... She was a very
competitive girl...

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:29.580
She practiced in this dojo
since she was little,

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:33.210
and achieved strength
that exceeded even adults.

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:38.420
Because of this, she became
a bit self-conceited...

00:17:38.420 --> 00:17:43.520
But then that's when
you appeared, Zoro.

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:46.190
I thank you.

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:49.300
You grew ever stronger, so she
started to practice even more,

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:52.970
so as not to lose to you.

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:56.630
So as not to lose to a boy...

00:17:57.970 --> 00:18:04.410
And she had begun to break down
the walls of female swordsmanship...

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:08.410
...but I'm an ordinary parent, too.

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:15.950
When I look at you now,
I feel pained, too...

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:29.290
<i>Sensei...</i>

00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:34.570
Let me have... that sword...

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:39.710
Kuina's sword?

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:43.520
I'm going to get stronger for her, too!

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:47.790
I'm going to get strong enough
that my name reaches to Heaven!

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:52.990
I'm going to be the world's
strongest swordsman!

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:56.260
I promised her...

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:57.920
I...

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:07.870
Yes. You can have it.

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:17.680
I leave Kuina's spirit
and dreams... with you.

00:20:01.190 --> 00:20:04.160
Eight years since then...

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:07.100
You're finally going to set out, then?

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:10.040
<i>Yes, Sensei.</i>

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:13.230
To fulfill our promise.

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:26.950
Zoro!

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:32.450
Take care.

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:40.070
Huh? That was way off!

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:41.870
What are you guys doing?!

00:20:41.870 --> 00:20:43.870
Cannon practice!

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:45.770
But they sure don't fly good!

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:49.440
I'm telling you, let me try!

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:52.280
Judging from the last flying distance...

00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:53.350
This should do it.

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:54.710
Fire!

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:59.220
Awesome! You hit it on your first try!

00:20:59.220 --> 00:21:01.190
I really hit it...

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:04.820
Whadya think?! I'm awesome when
it comes to aiming! Impressed?!

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:05.790
Yeah! Yeah!

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:08.430
It's settled! You're our sniper!

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:10.830
What?! I don't get to be captain?!

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:12.660
<i>I'm the captain!</i>

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:16.740
Well, whatever!
I'll humor you for now!

00:21:16.740 --> 00:21:20.270
But if you do anything too cowardly,
I'm taking over immediately!

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:21.270
Yeah, that's fine.

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:25.210
But anyways, I was thinking, there's
one other position we need to fill

00:21:25.210 --> 00:21:27.310
before going into the Grand Line!

00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:32.120
Yeah! We have a fancy kitchen, too!
If you pay me, I can do it!

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:34.190
An important necessity
for long trips, right?

00:21:34.190 --> 00:21:37.360
Yeah! All pirate ships need one, huh?!

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:38.860
A musician!

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:40.230
Are you an idiot?!

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:42.360
What do you see voyages as?!

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:45.030
Just when it seemed you were
gonna say something smart...

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:48.020
But pirates sing, you know!

00:21:50.300 --> 00:21:52.970
Come out, you damn pirates!

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:57.640
What the... What the...
Who are you?!

00:21:57.640 --> 00:22:02.980
Shut up! Who I am doesn't
amount to crap!

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:06.150
How many are there?

00:22:06.150 --> 00:22:08.290
One... I think?

00:22:08.290 --> 00:22:10.360
Then leave it to him.

00:22:10.360 --> 00:22:10.920
"Sea"
Then leave it to him.

00:22:10.920 --> 00:22:14.530
"Sea"
We've taken the heads of many a pirate!

00:22:14.530 --> 00:22:15.760
"Sea"
Are you nameless pirate wannabes
trying to kill my partner?!

00:22:15.760 --> 00:22:19.730
Are you nameless pirate wannabes
trying to kill my partner?!

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:20.500
That voice...

00:22:20.500 --> 00:22:22.300
What do you mean, "partner"?!

00:22:22.300 --> 00:22:27.070
I dunno what's going on,
but stop breaking our ship!

00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:32.770
L-lost by a hair...

00:22:33.780 --> 00:22:36.420
What's going on?

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:39.650
Hey! Is that you, Johnny?!

00:22:39.650 --> 00:22:43.320
Who's saying my name
all familiar-like?!

00:22:45.290 --> 00:22:47.230
B- Big Bro Zoro?!

00:22:47.230 --> 00:22:48.660
<i>It is you, Johnny!</i>

00:22:48.660 --> 00:22:50.100
<i>What are you doing here, Big Bro?!</i>

00:22:50.100 --> 00:22:52.300
Where's Yosaku? Isn't he with you?

00:22:52.300 --> 00:22:54.070
What now? What now?

00:22:54.070 --> 00:22:55.100
You guys know each other?

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:06.070
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:36.930
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:45.420
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:52.490
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.490 --> 00:24:02.490
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
